@page
@model Main.Pages.Games.HipocricitOathModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Hipocritic Oath";
}

<h2>Description</h2>

<p>
    <strong>Hipocritical Oath</strong> is a card game where
    <strong><em>you</em></strong> — a plain bystander — become the new "healer" of some medieval town.
</p>
<p>Do you know how to heal them? No. (Probably.)</p>
<p>Do your future clients know that? Not really.</p>
<p>Do you need any certification? Not in this era.</p>
<p>So sit down, take your first patient, and try everything you have at hand to cure them.</p>

<h2>Gameplay</h2>

<p>
    You will receive a hand of cards that you can use to treat your patient's illnesses.
</p>
<p>
    Each card can have a positive, negative, or neutral effect on symptoms.
</p>
<p>
    If you are satisfied with the patient's condition, you can move on to the next one.
</p>
<p>
    But beware — the cards in your hand are all you get for a day, and you have no idea how many ill people might show up. So use them wisely.
</p>
<p>
    This prototype was made during a Game Jam with the theme:
    <em>"How was I supposed to know that?"</em>
</p>

